OL,5,G2000 A Romanian Ransom
OL,6,     FIn 1958, a planeload of pigs was
OL,7,     Fsmuggled out of England and into
OL,8,     FRomania. The plane was the first
OL,9,     Fclue to a covert trade where farm
OL,10,     Fanimals were exchanged for Jewish
OL,11,     Flives.
